Multi-repository workspace operations

Usage:
  eshu workspace [command]

Available Commands:
  index       Removed: use eshu index <path> or eshu admin reindex instead
  plan        Removed: use eshu index <path> or eshu admin reindex instead
  status      Show workspace indexing status
  sync        Removed: use eshu index <path> or eshu admin reindex instead
  watch       Watch all repositories in a workspace for changes

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for workspace

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization

Use "eshu workspace [command] --help" for more information about a command.
